{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bounce. Rage. Repeat.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Pogo-Stick: Ultimate Challenge</strong> is not just a game \u2014 it\u2019s a test of inner strength and the ability to push through the pain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One bad bounce and you're all the way back.<br>No checkpoints. No forgiveness. No mercy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Control your pogo with just your mouse. Left click to compress the spring. Find your angle. Jump. Miss by a pixel. Scream. Try again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u26a0\ufe0f <strong>WARNING: This is a rage game.</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3663980/extras/fall.gif?t=1751656270\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will fall. You will rage. You will whisper, <i>&quot;Why am I doing this to myself?&quot;</i><br>If you\u2019re looking for a relaxing experience \u2014 this isn\u2019t it.<br>But if you crave brutal challenges, punishing falls, and the satisfaction of mastering the impossible\u2026 welcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Survive the challenge:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf32 Leap across forests, cliffs, and rage-inducing obstacles<br>\ud83d\udc80 Expect to fall hundreds of times<br>\ud83d\udd25 Feel the burn of every failed jump<br>\ud83c\udfc6 Earn your victory the hard way \u2014 or don\u2019t earn it at all<br><br><strong>Now with Multiplayer Mayhem.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Think you're suffering alone? Think again.<br>In the new <strong>Multiplayer Mode</strong>, up to <strong>4 players</strong> can bounce, fall, and scream <strong>together</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udea2 <strong>Use the rope</strong> to pull your friends up\u2026 or drag them down<br>\ud83d\udca5 Enable collisions for chaotic fun \u2014 or turn them off for serious climbing<br>\ud83d\ude02 Share the rage, the laughs, the betrayals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are no rules. Only gravity.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First steps","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3663980/e10c0ca0e034a1c0edb39ffb10bcbf85d8501e65.jpg"},{"name":"Path of the Apprentice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3663980/7ffbfa7ef4cecff5c09220492885fb30c70143a4.jpg"},{"name":"Path of the Warrior","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3663980/4ed8d1d7bd0b7374f533c4c105fc11bca0e64617.jpg"},{"name":"Master Sensei","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3663980/8bdea2db483ab51cc0df36609f736c9207500dda.jpg"}],"total":4},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3663980?t=1751656270","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3663980?t=1751656270","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3663980/a1ba5dc3155e834dd56ab2a58eb2777e6f01bf42/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751656270","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3663980/a1ba5dc3155e834dd56ab2a58eb2777e6f01bf42/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751656270","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bounce. Rage. Repeat.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Pogo-Stick: Ultimate Challenge</strong> is not just a game \u2014 it\u2019s a test of inner strength and the ability to push through the pain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One bad bounce and you're all the way back.<br>No checkpoints. No forgiveness. No mercy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Control your pogo with just your mouse. Left click to compress the spring. Find your angle. Jump. Miss by a pixel. Scream. Try again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u26a0\ufe0f <strong>WARNING: This is a rage game.</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3663980/extras/fall.gif?t=1751656270\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will fall. You will rage. You will whisper, <i>&quot;Why am I doing this to myself?&quot;</i><br>If you\u2019re looking for a relaxing experience \u2014 this isn\u2019t it.<br>But if you crave brutal challenges, punishing falls, and the satisfaction of mastering the impossible\u2026 welcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Survive the challenge:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf32 Leap across forests, cliffs, and rage-inducing obstacles<br>\ud83d\udc80 Expect to fall hundreds of times<br>\ud83d\udd25 Feel the burn of every failed jump<br>\ud83c\udfc6 Earn your victory the hard way \u2014 or don\u2019t earn it at all<br><br><strong>Now with Multiplayer Mayhem.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Think you're suffering alone? Think again.<br>In the new <strong>Multiplayer Mode</strong>, up to <strong>4 players</strong> can bounce, fall, and scream <strong>together</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udea2 <strong>Use the rope</strong> to pull your friends up\u2026 or drag them down<br>\ud83d\udca5 Enable collisions for chaotic fun \u2014 or turn them off for serious climbing<br>\ud83d\ude02 Share the rage, the laughs, the betrayals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are no rules. Only gravity.</p>","developers":["JovakGames"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3663980/c7136c38b85e6bbfe3a29d63d85101bce1cb0c16/header.jpg?